uickstart#登录与首次访问","content":"**不要**把 noVNC / WebUI / OneBot 端口裸暴露在公网。远程桌面没有固定默认密码，看容器日志即可。","locale":"zh"},"405":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#免密登录url-token","content":"每次手输密码很烦？WebUI 支持在地址里带上**登录密码**直接进入：","locale":"zh"},"406":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#免密登录url-token","content":"参数名是 `token`，**值就是你平时登录 WebUI 的密码**。SnowLuma 会用它走登录接口，密码正确即直达主页。","locale":"zh"},"407":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#免密登录url-token","content":"**用后即清**：密码读取后会**立即从地址栏移除**（`history.replaceState`），避免经浏览器历史 / 访问日志 / Referer 头泄露。","locale":"zh"},"408":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#免密登录url-token","content":"服务端照常校验，密码错误只会退回登录页，不存在绕过。","locale":"zh"},"409":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#免密登录url-token","content":"密码出现在 URL 里**风险较高**（会进浏览器历史、可能被中间设备 / 代理记录）。仅建议在可信的本地 / 内网环境使用；不要分享带密码的链接、不要贴进聊天 / issue、不要在公共设备上用。","locale":"zh"},"410":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#接下来","content":"选择部署方式 —— 各路径详细对比。","locale":"zh"},"411":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#接下来","content":"配置参考 —— 改端口、access token、适配器。","locale":"zh"},"412":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/quickstart#接下来","content":"更新 —— 升级而不丢登录态。","locale":"zh"},"413":{"id":"/zh/docs/mcp","page_id":"/zh/docs/mcp","type":"page","content":"MCP 使用","breadcrumbs":["Docs