":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#远程桌面密码","content":"**不设 `VNC_PASSWD`**：第一次启动会生成随机密码，**只在容器日志里打印一次**（中英各一行）。之后保存在数据卷里；重建容器或升级镜像，只要卷还在，密码不变，日志也不会再打。","locale":"zh"},"629":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#远程桌面密码","content":"**想用自己的密码**：启动时设置 `VNC_PASSWD`。只有你主动改这个值时才会换密码，并再打印一次。","locale":"zh"},"630":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#远程桌面密码","content":"环境变量里如果还写着旧文档的公开默认值，下次启动会当成「未设置」，换成新的随机密码。","locale":"zh"},"631":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#远程桌面密码","content":"`6081` 也不要裸放到公网。","locale":"zh"},"632":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#远程桌面密码","content":"查看当前密码（只在生成或你主动更换时会出现）：","locale":"zh"},"633":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#远程桌面密码","content":"重启后日志里找不到是正常的，用第一次记下的那串即可。","locale":"zh"},"634":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#ptrace-权限","content":"`--cap-add=SYS_PTRACE` 和 `--security-opt seccomp=unconfined` 仍然不能省。","locale":"zh"},"635":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker#ptrace-权限","content":"SnowLuma 的 native addon 通过 `ptrace` 把 hook 注入到容器内的 QQ 进程。官方镜像会给 `/usr/local/bin/node` 设置 `cap_sys_ptrace`，所以 SnowLuma 即使用 `snowluma` 普通用户运行，也能在容器的 capability 边界内完成注入。","locale":"zh"},"636":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/docker","tags":[