docker-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-docker#该看哪一页","content":"Windows 手动部署 —— 想跑原生 Windows QQ（`QQ.exe`）而不是容器里的 Linux QQ。","locale":"zh"},"1043":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","type":"page","content":"Windows 手动部署","breadcrumbs":["Docs","部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","locale":"zh"},"1044":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","content":"在原生 Windows 上直接运行 SnowLuma，hook 自动注入桌面版 QQ（QQ.exe）","locale":"zh"},"1045":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#准备工作","content":"准备工作","locale":"zh"},"1046":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#1-安装桌面版-qqntqq","content":"1\\. 安装桌面版 QQ（NTQQ）","locale":"zh"},"1047":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-3","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#2-下载-snowluma-发行包","content":"2\\. 下载 SnowLuma 发行包","locale":"zh"},"1048":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-4","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#3仅精简版安装-nodejs","content":"3.（仅精简版）安装 Node.js","locale":"zh"},"1049":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-5","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#解压并运行","content":"解压并运行","locale":"zh"},"1050":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-6","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#qq-与-snowluma-的启动顺序","content":"QQ 与 SnowLuma 的启动顺序","locale":"zh"},"1051":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-7","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#登录","content":"登录","locale":"zh"},"1052":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-8","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#关闭自动注入可选","content":"关闭自动注入（可选）","locale":"zh"},"1053":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-9","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#访问-webui-和-onebot","content":"访问 WebUI 和 OneBot","locale":"zh"},"1054":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-10","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#找-webui-临时密码","content":"找 WebUI 临时密码","locale":"zh"},"1055":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-11","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#配置文件落在哪","content":"配置文件落在哪","locale":"zh"},"1056":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-12","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#防火墙","content":"防火墙","locale":"zh"},"1057":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-13","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#下一步","content":"下一步","locale":"zh"},"1058":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-14","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","content":"在 Windows 上 SnowLuma **原生运行**，不需要 Docker、不需要 WSL2。你只要装好桌面版 QQ，下载对应的 SnowLuma 发行包解压，运行即可——SnowLuma 会自动发现 `QQ.exe` 并注入 hook。","locale":"zh"},"1059":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-15","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","content":"> 想用容器跑？见 Windows · Docker Desktop（注意：镜像是 Linux 的，跑的是 Linux QQ）。","locale":"zh"},"1060":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-16","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#1-安装桌面版-qqntqq","content":"从腾讯官网下载并安装 Windows 桌面版 QQ（NT 架构），装好后能正常打开 `QQ.exe`。SnowLuma 注入的是这个正在运行的 NTQQ 进程。","locale":"zh"},"1061":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-17","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#1-安装桌面版-qqntqq","content":"版本匹配很重要。SnowLuma 的 native hook 是按 QQ 版本对齐的。如果 QQ 自动升到了一个 SnowLuma 还不支持的新版本，hook 可能加载失败——遇到问题先看 WebUI / README 里的版本兼容说明。","locale":"zh"},"1062":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-18","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#2-下载-snowluma-发行包","content":"到 GitHub Releases 选 `win-x64`，两种风味二选一：","locale":"zh"},"1063":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-19","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#2-下载-snowluma-发行包","content":"包","locale":"zh"},"1064":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-20","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#2-下载-snowluma-发行包","content":"说明","locale":"zh"},"1065":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-21","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#2-下载-snowluma-发行包","content":"`SnowLuma-<TAG>-win-x64.tar.gz`","locale":"zh"},"1066":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-22","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#2-下载-snowluma-发行包","content":"**完整版**，内置 Node.js 运行时，不用单独装 Node，包体较大。","locale":"zh"},"1067":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-23","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#2-下载-snowluma-发行包","content":"`SnowLuma-<TAG>-win-x64-lite.tar.gz`","locale":"zh"},"1068":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-24","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#2-下载-snowluma-发行包","content":"**精简版**，不含 Node.js，需要你自己先装好 Node，体积小很多。","locale":"zh"},"1069":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-25","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#2-下载-snowluma-发行包","content":"把 `<TAG>` 换成你要的版本号（例如 `v1.10.0`）。","locale":"zh"},"1070":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-26","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#2-下载-snowluma-发行包","content":"不想折腾就选**完整版**，自带 Node，解压即用。","locale":"zh"},"1071":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-27","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#3仅精简版安装-nodejs","content":"SnowLuma 需要 **Node.js ≥ 22**。截至 2026 年，**Node 24（“Krypton”）是 Active LTS**，22（“Jod”）是 Maintenance LTS。精简版请安装 **Node 24 LTS**（22 也能跑）。","locale":"zh"},"1072":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-28","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#3仅精简版安装-nodejs","content":"到 nodejs.org 下载 Windows 安装包，装完用 PowerShell 验证：","locale":"zh"},"1073":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-29","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#3仅精简版安装-nodejs","content":"完整版自带运行时，**跳过这一步**。","locale":"zh"},"1074":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-30","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#解压并运行","content":"把下载的 tarball 解压到一个固定目录，例如 `C:\\SnowLuma\\`。解压后目录里有 `index.mjs`、`launcher.bat`、`webui/`、`native/` 等。","locale":"zh"},"1075":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-31","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#解压并运行","content":"`.tar.gz` 可以用 Windows 自带的 `tar`（Win10/11 已内置）解压：","locale":"zh"},"1076":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-32","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#解压并运行","content":"也可以用 7-Zip 等工具。","locale":"zh"},"1077":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-33","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#解压并运行","content":"进入解压目录后，双击 `launcher.bat` 启动（它本质就是跑 `node ./index.mjs` 再 `pause`，方便你看输出）。或者在终端里手动跑：","locale":"zh"},"1078":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-34","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#解压并运行","content":"完整版若用了内置 Node，请按 README 指引启动（一般直接 `launcher.bat` 即可）；具体见 WebUI / README。","locale":"zh"},"1079":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-35","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#qq-与-snowluma-的启动顺序","content":"SnowLuma 默认开启 **hook 自动加载**：它会持续探测系统里的 QQ 主进程，发现 `QQ.exe` 就自动把 hook 注入进去（先进入被动观察），等你扫码登录完成后，hook 自动从被动观察切到工作模式。","locale":"zh"},"1080":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-36","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#qq-与-snowluma-的启动顺序","content":"所以两种顺序都行：","locale":"zh"},"1081":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-37","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#qq-与-snowluma-的启动顺序","content":"**先开 QQ 再开 SnowLuma**：SnowLuma 启动后立刻发现已在运行的 `QQ.exe` 并注入。","locale":"zh"},"1082":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-38","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#qq-与-snowluma-的启动顺序","content":"**先开 SnowLuma 再开 QQ**：SnowLuma 会等到 `QQ.exe` 出现后再注入。","locale":"zh"},"1083":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-39","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#qq-与-snowluma-的启动顺序","content":"**必须用和 QQ 相同的 Windows 用户运行 SnowLuma。** 注入需要能访问目标进程；如果 SnowLuma 和 QQ 跑在不同用户（或权限不对等）下，注入会失败。如果一个以管理员身份运行、另一个没有，也可能注入不上——保持二者权限一致。","locale":"zh"},"1084":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-40","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#登录","content":"登录**只支持扫码**：在桌面上打开的 QQ 窗口里用手机 QQ 扫码登录。原生 Windows 上你本来就能看到 QQ 窗口，不需要 VNC/noVNC（那是 Linux 无头环境才用的）。","locale":"zh"},"1085":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-41","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#关闭自动注入可选","content":"想保留传统的“WebUI 里手动 Load”流程，把 `runtime.json` 里的 `hookAutoLoad` 设为 `false`，或设环境变量 `SNOWLUMA_HOOK_AUTOLOAD=0`。环境变量优先。","locale":"zh"},"1086":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-42","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#访问-webui-和-onebot","content":"启动后，默认监听这些端口：","locale":"zh"},"1087":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-43","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#访问-webui-和-onebot","content":"端口","locale":"zh"},"1088":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-44","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#访问-webui-和-onebot","content":"用途","locale":"zh"},"1089":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-45","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#访问-webui-和-onebot","content":"`5099`","locale":"zh"},"1090":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-46","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#访问-webui-和-onebot","content":"SnowLuma WebUI","locale":"zh"},"1091":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-47","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#访问-webui-和-onebot","content":"`3000`","locale":"zh"},"1092":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-48","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#访问-webui-和-onebot","content":"OneBot HTTP（默认）","locale":"zh"},"1093":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-49","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#访问-webui-和-onebot","content":"`3001`","locale":"zh"},"1094":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-50","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#访问-webui-和-onebot","content":"OneBot WebSocket（默认）","locale":"zh"},"1095":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-51","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#访问-webui-和-onebot","content":"浏览器打开 WebUI：","locale":"zh"},"1096":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-52","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#找-webui-临时密码","content":"**全新数据目录首次启动**时，会在控制台 / 日志里输出一次性管理员密码。从 `launcher.bat` 弹出的控制台窗口里翻一下即可（找含“临时密码 / initial credentials”的那行）。","locale":"zh"},"1097":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-53","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#找-webui-临时密码","content":"临时密码**只在全新数据目录首次启动时**输出一次，复用旧目录或重启都不会重新生成。具体提示文案见 WebUI / README。","locale":"zh"},"1098":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-54","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#配置文件落在哪","content":"首次运行会在数据目录下自动创建配置：","locale":"zh"},"1099":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-55","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#配置文件落在哪","content":"文件","locale":"zh"},"1100":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-56","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#配置文件落在哪","content":"作用","locale":"zh"},"1101":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-57","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#配置文件落在哪","content":"`config/onebot.json`","locale":"zh"},"1102":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-58","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#配置文件落在哪","content":"全局默认 OneBot 配置。","locale":"zh"},"1103":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-59","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#配置文件落在哪","content":"`config/onebot_<uin>.json`","locale":"zh"},"1104":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-60","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#配置文件落在哪","content":"每个账号一份（按 UIN）。","locale":"zh"},"1105":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-61","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#配置文件落在哪","content":"`config/runtime.json`","locale":"zh"},"1106":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-62","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#配置文件落在哪","content":"WebUI 端口、`hookAutoLoad`、日志级别等运行时设置。","locale":"zh"},"1107":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-63","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#配置文件落在哪","content":"环境变量优先级高于 `runtime.json`。多账号无需手动配置：每登录一个 UIN，SnowLuma 自动拉起一个 OneBot 实例。配置项详解见 配置参考。","locale":"zh"},"1108":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-64","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#配置文件落在哪","content":"数据目录的确切位置见 WebUI / README（不同打包方式可能不同）。","locale":"zh"},"1109":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-65","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#防火墙","content":"首次启动时，Windows 防火墙可能弹窗询问是否放行 `node` / SnowLuma 的网络访问。","locale":"zh"},"1110":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-66","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#防火墙","content":"只在**本机**访问（`127.0.0.1`）时，可以不放行公网。","locale":"zh"},"1111":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-67","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#防火墙","content":"想让局域网内其它设备访问 WebUI / OneBot，需要在防火墙放行对应端口（`5099` / `3000` / `3001`）。","locale":"zh"},"1112":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-68","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#防火墙","content":"**不要把 WebUI / OneBot 端口裸暴露到公网。** 这些端口能完全控制你的 QQ。如需远程访问，请走反向代理 + 鉴权或内网穿透 + 鉴权，并改掉默认凭据。","locale":"zh"},"1113":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-69","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#下一步","content":"配置参考 —— OneBot / runtime 配置项详解。","locale":"zh"},"1114":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-70","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#下一步","content":"快速开始 —— 连接你的第一个 OneBot 客户端。","locale":"zh"},"1115":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-71","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#下一步","content":"MCP 使用 / SDK —— 二次开发。","locale":"zh"},"1116":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows-72","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/windows#下一步","content":"其它平台：Docker（Linux）、WSL2、部署方式总览。","locale":"zh"},"1117":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/wsl2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/wsl2","type":"page","content":"WSL2","breadcrumbs":["Docs","部署"],"tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/wsl2","locale":"zh"},"1118":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/wsl2-0","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/wsl2","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/wsl2","content":"在 Windows 的 WSL2 里运行 SnowLuma 的 Linux 容器","locale":"zh"},"1119":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/wsl2-1","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/wsl2","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/wsl2#1-安装-wsl2","content":"1\\. 安装 WSL2","locale":"zh"},"1120":{"id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/wsl2-2","page_id":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/wsl2","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/zh/docs/guide/deploy/wsl2#2-在-wsl2-里准备-dock